&lt;li&gt;Use your technical expertise to build delightful user experience and high-scale data systems that power internal teams and product features used by many millions of users every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver business results by collaborating with stakeholders across Discord to experiment on features, machine learning models and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 7+ years of experience as a full-stack SWE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built internal tools, and are familiar with A/B testing and statistical frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with experimentation tooling; experience building core parts of experimentation platforms from scratch is a huge plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have extensive experience leading complex technical projects with successful outcomes; you can take a high-level goal and achieve a shippable solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built systems with strong data governance controls that respect privacy and security principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in Python and SQL. Experience with Typescript or Rust is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and with and/or exposure to a variety of datastores (relational, NoSQL, data warehouse solutions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product sense and communication skills - you understand your customers and work well cross-functionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of developing engineers at multiple levels, and a habit of tracking industry trends to bring new techniques to technical problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
