&lt;li&gt;Experience taking systems from initial definition through implementation, tuning, and a shippable state&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate ambiguous design problems into clear documentation that engineering, production, and other design partners can act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with combat, gameplay, or content designers to align progression systems with moment-to-moment gameplay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of learning from feedback,

